  "details": "A new instance should not be considered to be renamed before it is ever joined.\n\nA new Group/Group+ instance being created for the first time is unable to be named using the VRC+ exclusive naming system, as the instance is considered to be \"renamed\" at that point (see \"Instance rename failed\" in the screenshot.\n\nThis means that my group members are unable to create new named instances (despite subscribing to present a named lobby) without being able to also close ***any*** group instance.\n\nThis is the only relevant permission, which affects all instance types for that group:\n\nManage Group Instances\n\nAllows role to rename or close a group instance.",
